  "source_contract": [
    "The 4608 FP16 values are channel-scaled Cube output. Vector preserves the FP16 boundary, applies the input row scale, clamp, SwiGLU, full-width absmax and the original rounding. These operations already run in one epilogue.",
    "The FP32 activation scale remains live at GMM2 output dequantization/combine for both return paths. GMM2 reads the INT8 activation. Neither GEMM, either scale operation nor an operator launch disappears.",
    "An FP16 row spans 18 Cube output N tiles of 256 columns. Each gate half must meet its matching up half and the 2304-wide reduction must complete before requantization. The same INT8 row feeds 20 GMM2 output-column tiles; transfer to every reader must still be paid."
